Subject: [PATCH 1417/3799] soh: rename func_8099A3A4 ->
 DoorWarp1_AdultWarpAppear

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: grows the adult dungeon warp in, fading the light ray and warp body up to full and expanding its scale until it reaches full size, then hands off to DoorWarp1_AdultWarpIdle.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Door_Warp1/z_door_warp1.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
